; THE STILL QUAY (hidden realm) — where the way from the Sunspire library lets out. Authored in the
; content frame; tools/shift_cell_content.py moves it to the spec's origin. The door home is built by
; RegionSetup at the region's PortalPoint (content (0, 26), the south end of the quay); the player
; arrives at SpawnPoint (content (0, 10)). Lamps lit at an hour that never ends.

